#describe after Blank issues disabled; docs and security links shown.
#describe verified pnpm run typecheck and pnpm test pass.
+ .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/config.yml
~ .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.md
~ .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/feature_request.md
