#order .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/feature_request.md
#reason .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/config.yml Disables blank issues and points reporters to the docs and private security reporting.
#reason .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.md Gives bug reports a recognisable default title prefix.
#reason .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/feature_request.md Gives feature requests a recognisable default title prefix.
#story Reporting an issue
#step actor A reporter
#step action opens
#file .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/config.yml
#step subject the new issue page
